      "content": "We'd like a separate miRNA-protein partial-correlation network for each of our 50 heart-failure patients, from 300 serum miRNAs and a plasma proteomics panel measured on the same patients (complete, continuous, matching IDs). The catch: I don't remember whether the proteomics we got back is the 200-protein targeted panel or the 2,000-protein discovery panel, and the files are still on the CRO's server."
