      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Before I choose a workflow, please tell me:\n- Which of these is right: 200 or 2,000?\n  You wrote: \"I don't remember whether the proteomics we got back is the 200-protein targeted panel or the 2,000-protein discovery panel\".\n  - 200: LIONESS-DRAGON can do this\n  - 2,000: no registered workflow can do this as asked -- LIONESS-DRAGON writes at most 20,000,000 values (features x (features - 1) / 2 x samples); 2,300 features and 50 samples give 132,192,500\n\nNo workflow has been selected and nothing runs before you answer.\n\nNo files were inspected and no analysis ran."
